### Master Node - All Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:9000

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List Workers
GET {{baseUrl}}/workers

### Get Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### Register Worker
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "worker_id": "worker-1",
  "port": 8001,
  "host": "localhost"
}

### Register Worker 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "worker_id": "worker-2",
  "port": 8002,
  "host": "localhost"
}

### Remove Worker
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/worker/worker-1

### Clear All Workers
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/workers/clear